  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#42- Snowy Samuel\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,22,40]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A white ram with fiery red eyes and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,40,76]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "huge horns appears before you. It\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,76,110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is surrounded by an aura of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,110,138]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wickedness that terrifies you. Save\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,138,174]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vs. L6 Fear, adding +1 if you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,174,209]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Will Skill at Expert level (add no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,209,248]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bonus for the Will Skill at basic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,248,282]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "level). If you fail, you lose 2 Sanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,282,321]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "AND you must run from this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,321,348]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter. As you move to a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,348,376]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "neighboring area, roll on the Witch\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,376,412]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Children table to determine who\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,412,444]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will attack you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,444,461]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you succeed, you have to fight\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,461,495]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Snowy Samuel. Treat it as a L6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,495,526]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Demon with 8 Life. He inflicts 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,526,559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Damage with his horns, and is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,559,589]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vulnerable to holy water (a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,589,617]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "splashed vial will inflict 2 damage).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,617,655]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may not escape from this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,655,684]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter. In addition, if you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,684,720]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a firearm, you will be able to use it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,720,758]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "only on your first attack (or two\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,758,792]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attacks if you have an assault rifle\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,792,829]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and choose to shoot twice at the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,829,862]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "charging goat, using 3 bullets to do\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,862,899]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "so). After the first attack, Snowy\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,899,934]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Samuel will automatically disarm\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,934,967]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you and you will have to spend 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,967,1000]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "action to draw a melee weapon like\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1000,1035]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a knife, or fight unarmed at -2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1035,1068]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you defeat Snowy Samuel, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1068,1100]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "gain 2 XP and all creatures from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1100,1137]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Witch Children table that you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1137,1172]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter in the rest of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1172,1201]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "campaign will have -1 to their L.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1201,1235]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This is a permanent effect. In\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1235,1266]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "addition, at the end of the battle\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1266,1301]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will find an item from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1301,1332]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random Magic Items table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[96,1332,1358]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Each of these events may happen only once. As it happens cross it off the table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,22,103]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Roll on the Special Events table if you roll an event that already happened. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,103,183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "all Random events have occurred, treat any result of 7 on the exploration table\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,183,263]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "as “House”.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,263,275]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random events table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,275,300]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,300,302]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You meet a kid who wants to follow you. If you refuse, he will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,302,365]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "go away. If you let him join your exploration, roll d6. On a 1-3,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,365,431]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "go to event #26, on a 4-6 go to event #37.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,431,474]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,474,476]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find something (roll on the Random Objects or the Useful\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,476,537]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Stuff table, your choice) spattered in blood. You may decide\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,537,598]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to ignore the object or pick it up (go to event #31).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,598,652]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,652,654]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You spot a random object on a dangerous place. Roll on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,654,713]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random Object or on the Useful Stuff table (your choice) to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,713,773]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "determine what it is. Climbing the obstacle will require a L4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,773,835]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "climbing roll, at +1 if you have the Agile Skill, +2 if you have it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,835,903]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "at Expert level. On a failure, you fall and lose 1 Life. On a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,903,965]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "success, you gain the object. You may try to climb the obstacle\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,965,1029]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "as many times as you want.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1029,1056]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1056,1058]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A ghastly face appears at a window. Save vs. L3 Fear (+1 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1058,1122]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have Will, +2 if you have Will at Expert level) or lose 1 Sanity.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1122,1188]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-042:p0065",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you want to enter the building and investigate, go to event\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[97,1188,1251]]"
    }
  ],
